WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.866 --> 00:00:02.569
- [sighs]
- [clears throat]

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:05.772
- CAN YOU TOTALLY CHILL OUT?
- NO, I'M SO ANNOYED RIGHT NOW.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.640
CAN YOU, LIKE, NOT TALK TO ME
FOR, LIKE, A SECOND?

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.709
LIKE, THAT'D BE GREAT.
THAT'D BE FINE.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.177
THAT'D BE FINE BY ME.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.346
WHAT?
OH, MY GOD, ARE YOU SERIOUS?

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.515
THIS IS BULL[bleep].
WHAT COULD POSSIBLY

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.750
BE THE PROBLEM WITH LETTING
TWO MORE PEOPLE IN?

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.619
- CHECK YOUR GIRL, BRO.

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.454
- I'M SORRY.
- EXCUSE ME, WHAT DID YOU SAY?

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:23.890
"CHECK YOUR GIRL"? UH-UHH,
IT DOESN'T WORK LIKE THAT.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.925
NO ONE CHECKS ME
BECAUSE I'M NOT LUGGAGE.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:30.597
OKAY? SO YOU CAN GO
[bleep] YOURSEE-ELF.

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.499
- MEEGAN, SERIOUSLY,

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:34.734
TWO MORE PEOPLE ARE GONNA
COME OUT IN A COUPLE OF SECONDS,

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.035
AND THEN WE CAN GO IN.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.536
- NO!
LET ME ASK YOU A QUESTION.

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:39.138
WHAT WAS IT LIKE
BEING IN<i> THE GREEN MILE?</i>

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.173
- HE WASN'T IN<i> THE GREEN MILE!</i>

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:42.608
HE CLEARLY WASN'T
IN THAT MOVIE.

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:44.477
- WHAT DOES TOM HANKS'S PENIS
FEEL LIKE?

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.579
- MEEGAN!
- MOREOVER, HOW DOES IT FEEL

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.881
WHEN SWARMS OF BEES
ARE COMING OUT OF YOUR FACE?

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.783
- SERIOUSLY, I'M SORRY.
IT'S, LIKE, HER FAVORITE MOVIE.

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:52.018
- DON'T APOLOGIZE FOR ME!

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:53.419
YEAH, THIS IS NICE,
THIS IS NICE.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:55.655
YOU LOOK LIKE COMMON MEETS
THE INCREDIBLE HULK.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:56.890
- MEEGAN--
- WHEN YOU BROUGHT

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.691
THE FRANKINCENSE TO BABY JESUS,
DID THEY, LIKE...

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.627
- OH.
- MAKE YOU STAND

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.128
OUTSIDE THE BARN
BECAUSE YOU WERE TOO BIG,

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.830
OR DID THEY INVITE YOU IN
WITH ALL THE OTHER ANIMALS?

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.198
DON'T FLARE YOUR NOSTRILS
AT ME,

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:07.967
OKAY?
- HE'S--

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.502
- DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA
HOW IMPOLITE THAT IS?

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:13.973
- HE HASN'T MOVED HIS NOSTRILS
ONCE SINCE WE GOT HERE.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.308
- I SAW THEM MOVE!
- THEY DID NOT MOVE, MEEGAN.

00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:17.376
- THEY FLARED!

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:19.112
- MEEGAN, THEY [bleep]
DID NOT MOVE!

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:23.182
- YOUR NOSTRILS FLARED MORE THAN
A SURVIVOR FROM A BOAT ACCIDENT.

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:24.450
- WHAT?

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.451
- HE'S NOT EVEN LOOKING ME
IN THE EYES.

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:26.852
OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:29.322
IF YOU'RE JUST GOING TO CONTINUE
TO BE A LITTLE PRICK,

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:31.423
YOU'RE GONNA GET YOUR ASS
KICKED.

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:34.027
- DON'T TOUCH HIM, MEE--
MEEGAN.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.428
- [scoffs]
CRAZY BITCH.

00:01:36.428 --> 00:01:38.364
- [gasps]

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.532
[squeaks]

00:01:40.532 --> 00:01:42.569
- [sighs]

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:47.974
OH!

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:50.443
- I TOTALLY LOVE MY NAILS
RIGHT NOW.

00:01:52.077 --> 00:01:54.214
I'M SO OVER EVERYTHING
RIGHT NOW,

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.949
OVER THE FLOOR,
I'M OVER THE SKY, I'M OVER YOU,

00:01:56.949 --> 00:01:58.384
OVER THAT PUSSY BACK THERE.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.086
YOU'RE A PUSSY!

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.887
- MEEGAN, SERIOUSLY.
- WHATEVER.

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:03.522
- [makes kissing sounds]

00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:04.991
- NICE LEGS, LITTLE LADY.
[laughter]

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:08.094
- UM, EXCUSE ME?

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:09.862
- OH, GOD!

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:11.463
- HEY, WHAT DID YOU SAY?

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:14.566
WHAT THE [bleep]
DID YOU JUST SAY?

00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:18.705
YOU GUYS COME BACK HERE WITH
YOUR LITTLE ITTY-BITTY DICKS.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.009
- YOU BEST CONTROL YOUR LADY.

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:24.643
- YUP.
- [gasps] EXCUSE--

00:02:24.643 --> 00:02:28.081
"CONTROL YOUR LADY"?
NO, HE DOESN'T CONTROL ME,

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:30.917
'CAUSE LET ME TELL YOU
SOMETHING, I'M NOT A REMOTE.

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.652
- MEEGAN, BABY,
CAN WE JUST LET THIS GO?

00:02:33.652 --> 00:02:35.788
- NO, I'M TALKING TO THE PUSSIES
OF ANARCHY RIGHT NOW.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.289
- OH, BOY.
- YEAH, YOU.

00:02:37.289 --> 00:02:39.525
WHY DON'T YOU ALL
GATHER YOURSELVES,

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:41.694
AND WHY DON'T YOU JUST GO
AND FIGURE OUT A WAY

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.897
TO [bleep] ON EACH OTHER'S
LEATHERY PENI.

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:46.899
- HEY, [bleep] YOU, BITCH!
- [gasps]

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:49.903
- OH, NO.
- [squeaks]

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:54.908
- [sighs]

00:02:56.408 --> 00:02:59.545
IT'S NOT EVEN THE PLURAL
OF "PENIS."

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:00.546
[punching thud]
- YEAH!

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:01.713
[thugs laughing]

00:03:01.713 --> 00:03:05.885
- I'M THE QUEEN OF THE WORLD!

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.621
YES!
I FEEL INVINCIBLE!

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:11.958
LIKE I HAVE SUPER POWERS
OR SOMETHING. HA HA!

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.360
YOU HEAR THAT,
ALL YOU [bleep] OF THE WORLD?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:17.196
I CAN DO ANYTHING I WANT,
AND NO ONE CAN STOP ME.

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:19.264
- BECAUSE YOU DON'T HAVE TO
FIGHT YOUR OWN FIGHTS,

00:03:19.264 --> 00:03:21.000
YOU CRAZY BITCH!
- [gasps]

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.669
- OH, BOY.
- [squeaks]

00:03:23.669 --> 00:03:27.172
- OH, NO.

00:03:27.172 --> 00:03:29.308
- [squeaks]

00:03:29.308 --> 00:03:31.043
- [sighs]

00:03:31.043 --> 00:03:34.180
UGH! OH.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.649
- NOTHING CAN STOP ME!

